---
// The four AI visibility signals as Apple-style spec cards: a name, one big
// typographic figure and a short line of copy (illustrative values).
---
<div class="specs">
  <article class="spec reveal">
    <h3>Mentioned</h3>
    <p class="big quote" aria-hidden="true">“…the strongest fit is <b>Your&nbsp;Brand</b>.”</p>
    <p class="desc"><strong>Your name is in the answer.</strong> When buyers ask about your category or their problem, the assistant says who you are.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="spec reveal" style="--d:80ms">
    <h3>Cited</h3>
    <p class="big site" aria-hidden="true">yourbrand.com<sup>1</sup></p>
    <p class="desc"><strong>Your page is the source.</strong> The answer links to your site as its evidence.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="spec reveal" style="--d:120ms">
    <h3>Recommended</h3>
    <p class="big num" aria-hidden="true">#1</p>
    <p class="desc"><strong>You make the shortlist.</strong> The answer suggests you for the buyer’s situation, not just in a list.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="spec reveal" style="--d:160ms">
    <h3>Accurate</h3>
    <p class="big num" aria-hidden="true">3/3</p>
    <p class="desc"><strong>What AI says is true.</strong> Offer, prices and locations match your site. Outdated facts get fixed at the source.</p>
  </article>
</div>

<style>
  .specs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--gap); }
  .spec { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 440px; padding: 40px 44px; border-radius: var(--r-card); background: var(--white); }
  .spec h3 { font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.19; letter-spacing: 0.011em; }
  .big { margin: auto 0; padding: 36px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  .quote { font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.18; letter-spacing: 0.004em; color: var(--steel); }
  .quote b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .site { font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.1; }
  .site sup { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; margin-left: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blue); color: #fff; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: 18px; }
  .num { font-size: 120px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .desc { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.47; letter-spacing: -0.022em; color: var(--steel); }
  .desc strong { color: var(--ink); }
  @media (max-width: 834px) { .specs { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .spec { min-height: 0; } }
  @media (max-width: 734px) { .spec { padding: 32px 28px; } .num { font-size: 96px; } .quote { font-size: 28px; } .site { font-size: 30px; } }
</style>
